    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, fatty meals. That makes it worse. Only lying still, and it's not much. Honestly, a couple of times a week. I've been feeling sick too. I mean, as for feeling sick, it's mild, honestly. It comes and goes. I had pain going to my right shoulder before. That's settled now, though.",
